(3929370, 558236, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.   I would love to be standing there listening to the rythmic sound of that water. My only suggestion would be to take this at either sunrise or sunset to avoid the midday light.  But it really looks beautiful here too.</td>', 'This is beautiful.   I would love to be standing there listening to the rythmic sound of that water. My only suggestion would be to take this at either sunrise or sunset to avoid the midday light.  But it really looks beautiful here too.', '2007-07-23 18:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
