(3929396, 559223, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I think the composition is a little too static. Perhaps stepping over to the right a bit more and lining up their profiles would have given this more of an edge.</td>', 'Hmmm... I think the composition is a little too static. Perhaps stepping over to the right a bit more and lining up their profiles would have given this more of an edge.', '2007-07-23 18:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
