(3930629, 559137, 61818, '<td valign="top">Certainly a unique/home-grown entry.  Perhaps increased DoF to get them all in focus would turn it up a notch, but in the end we''re talking about a bunch of clothes pins here so its an uphill battle trying to inject the ellusive ''wow''.</td>', 'Certainly a unique/home-grown entry.  Perhaps increased DoF to get them all in focus would turn it up a notch, but in the end we''re talking about a bunch of clothes pins here so its an uphill battle trying to inject the ellusive ''wow''.', '2007-07-24 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930632, 559219, 48228, '<td valign="top">Perfect rhythm shot here, and so refreshing and tranquil.....very zen like.....</td>', 'Perfect rhythm shot here, and so refreshing and tranquil.....very zen like.....', '2007-07-24 00:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930637, 558440, 48228, '<td valign="top">I can definately see and feel the rhythm in this one.....</td>', 'I can definately see and feel the rhythm in this one.....', '2007-07-24 00:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930638, 559107, 61818, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a real sense of rhythm from this shot, but then again I do get a sense of atonal melody.  There''s no well defined paattern, but there are many contrasts in shape and color which do have a (somewhat jarring) effect.</td>', 'I don''t get a real sense of rhythm from this shot, but then again I do get a sense of atonal melody.  There''s no well defined paattern, but there are many contrasts in shape and color which do have a (somewhat jarring) effect.', '2007-07-24 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930640, 559095, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice rhythm and patterns in this image.....</td>', 'Nice rhythm and patterns in this image.....', '2007-07-24 00:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930641, 558888, 48228, '<td valign="top">perfect rhythm here and love this silhouette.....</td>', 'perfect rhythm here and love this silhouette.....', '2007-07-24 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930643, 559175, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing DOF in this rhythm image.....</td>', 'Very pleasing DOF in this rhythm image.....', '2007-07-24 00:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930645, 559262, 61818, '<td valign="top">You have an eye for the patterns created by the bottles, and the lights and darks add another layer of patterns as well.  Unfortunately nothing can save this shot from the poor focus which it suffers from.  Hopefully another challenge comes along which lets you explore this again, because I think if this were not suffering from so much blur it would really have a good impact, simple as it is.</td>', 'You have an eye for the patterns created by the bottles, and the lights and darks add another layer of patterns as well.  Unfortunately nothing can save this shot from the poor focus which it suffers from.  Hopefully another challenge comes along which lets you explore this again, because I think if this were not suffering from so much blur it would really have a good impact, simple as it is.', '2007-07-24 00:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930650, 559094, 61818, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect.  Unfortunately I don''t find anything here serving as a strong subject, nor is it chaotic enough to grab me as an abstract.</td>', 'An interesting effect.  Unfortunately I don''t find anything here serving as a strong subject, nor is it chaotic enough to grab me as an abstract.', '2007-07-24 00:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930654, 559277, 61818, '<td valign="top">The sky is such a distraction here that it overwhelms any paterns/rhythms offered by the masts.</td>', 'The sky is such a distraction here that it overwhelms any paterns/rhythms offered by the masts.', '2007-07-24 00:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930664, 559204, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns in the shell, but your title is presenting this as a study of the water itself.  The water is almost invisible it is so insignifigant in the shot.  At the same time, the interesting patterns in the shell are not taken advantage of in any way which allows them to define the photo.  I feel like there are two thoughts here, neither of which is strong enough to pull me in but either of which might do so if presented differently.</td>', 'Nice patterns in the shell, but your title is presenting this as a study of the water itself.  The water is almost invisible it is so insignifigant in the shot.  At the same time, the interesting patterns in the shell are not taken advantage of in any way which allows them to define the photo.  I feel like there are two thoughts here, neither of which is strong enough to pull me in but either of which might do so if presented differently.', '2007-07-24 00:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930667, 559074, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful abstract.  A subtle rhythmic pattern that engages me but remains difficult to define.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a beautiful abstract.  A subtle rhythmic pattern that engages me but remains difficult to define.  Great job.', '2007-07-24 00:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930674, 557427, 61818, '<td valign="top">Something is odd about this shot.  I can''t tell if its some processing applied to the birds, or if the scale of the birds compared to the background is what is throwing me - but the birds look as if they were pasted onto the scene.  It''s a very disconcerting effect.  Look forward to reading your notes after the challenge.</td>', 'Something is odd about this shot.  I can''t tell if its some processing applied to the birds, or if the scale of the birds compared to the background is what is throwing me - but the birds look as if they were pasted onto the scene.  It''s a very disconcerting effect.  Look forward to reading your notes after the challenge.', '2007-07-24 00:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930680, 558868, 61818, '<td valign="top">I wish the back wall were in focus as I think it would take a very mundane rhythm (horizontal rectangles) and add just the right splash of jazz to it (vertical shapes, repeating arches, irregular sized blocks).  I do like the play of light and shadow behind the main subject.</td>', 'I wish the back wall were in focus as I think it would take a very mundane rhythm (horizontal rectangles) and add just the right splash of jazz to it (vertical shapes, repeating arches, irregular sized blocks).  I do like the play of light and shadow behind the main subject.', '2007-07-24 00:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930682, 557950, 61818, '<td valign="top">An interesting experiment, but not one that is working for me.</td>', 'An interesting experiment, but not one that is working for me.', '2007-07-24 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930685, 556433, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not very attractive lighting, and my archnemesis "the jaggies" seems to be wreaking havoc with your diagonal lines.</td>', 'Not very attractive lighting, and my archnemesis "the jaggies" seems to be wreaking havoc with your diagonal lines.', '2007-07-24 00:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930691, 558977, 61818, '<td valign="top">I love the violin, and I tend to be drawn to pictures of it as well.  Unfortunately I don''t find that its shape lends itself to the challenge as there aren''t very strong, repeating patterns inherent in it.</td>', 'I love the violin, and I tend to be drawn to pictures of it as well.  Unfortunately I don''t find that its shape lends itself to the challenge as there aren''t very strong, repeating patterns inherent in it.', '2007-07-24 00:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930694, 558873, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes which form an interesting pattern.  I wish they were more dominant in the frame.  Being overwhelmed by the sky, they really lose their impact.</td>', 'Nice silhouettes which form an interesting pattern.  I wish they were more dominant in the frame.  Being overwhelmed by the sky, they really lose their impact.', '2007-07-24 00:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930709, 557709, 61818, '<td valign="top">I imagine this has some appeal to a fan of very esoteric, minimalist art.  I''m not a fan, but I admire your courage for submitting it.</td>', 'I imagine this has some appeal to a fan of very esoteric, minimalist art.  I''m not a fan, but I admire your courage for submitting it.', '2007-07-24 00:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930714, 558412, 61818, '<td valign="top">Too defined to be an abstract, not enough definition to really hook me on the patterns being presented here.  Overall I like this, but its just not as powerful as I think it could be.</td>', 'Too defined to be an abstract, not enough definition to really hook me on the patterns being presented here.  Overall I like this, but its just not as powerful as I think it could be.', '2007-07-24 00:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930720, 559281, 61818, '<td valign="top">Don''t really see any repeating pattern here.  Yes there is more than one bird, but that''s not quite the same thing.  Setting the challenge aside, I think this would pop a bit more if you cropped off the two blurriest birds on the left and got the feeding dish down on the thirds intersection in the lower left.  That might present a pleasing, sweeping arc of the dish and the birds to the right swooping upwards in the frame.</td>', 'Don''t really see any repeating pattern here.  Yes there is more than one bird, but that''s not quite the same thing.  Setting the challenge aside, I think this would pop a bit more if you cropped off the two blurriest birds on the left and got the feeding dish down on the thirds intersection in the lower left.  That might present a pleasing, sweeping arc of the dish and the birds to the right swooping upwards in the frame.', '2007-07-24 00:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930725, 558555, 61818, '<td valign="top">The only strong repeating patterns here are the strings and the frets, both of which come across as being entirely incidental to the shot.  The smashed body of the guitar draws the eye and keeps it there, leaving the patterns to beat out a rhythm which goes unheard.</td>', 'The only strong repeating patterns here are the strings and the frets, both of which come across as being entirely incidental to the shot.  The smashed body of the guitar draws the eye and keeps it there, leaving the patterns to beat out a rhythm which goes unheard.', '2007-07-24 00:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930732, 559095, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice eye.  Pity the windows weren''t equally horizontally spaced.  Still, some crazy people like odd meters.  The world can''t be all 4/4.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice eye.  Pity the windows weren''t equally horizontally spaced.  Still, some crazy people like odd meters.  The world can''t be all 4/4.  Nicely done.', '2007-07-24 00:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930740, 559019, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns, but I don''t get an overall sense of rhythm in the shot.  Here''s some patterns, there''s some patterns.  What ties this together?</td>', 'Nice patterns, but I don''t get an overall sense of rhythm in the shot.  Here''s some patterns, there''s some patterns.  What ties this together?', '2007-07-24 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930749, 558808, 61818, '<td valign="top">No real rhythm here, title notwithstanding.  Lot of abstract lines in the water, and then a chain which happens to be hanging out there for some reason.  Actually if the chain were in better focus, this might have drawn me in.  Hard to say, this is not an easy shot to like.</td>', 'No real rhythm here, title notwithstanding.  Lot of abstract lines in the water, and then a chain which happens to be hanging out there for some reason.  Actually if the chain were in better focus, this might have drawn me in.  Hard to say, this is not an easy shot to like.', '2007-07-24 00:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930753, 559207, 61818, '<td valign="top">No repeating patterns at all, certainly none that are defining the shot.</td>', 'No repeating patterns at all, certainly none that are defining the shot.', '2007-07-24 01:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930761, 559266, 61818, '<td valign="top">Hmm, comes across as a strong shoehorn rhythm from someone who happened to be sitting on a bunch of race shots and wanted to get one in the challenge.  I could buy into repeating patterns of dismiliar cars with dismiliar colors, shapes, focus, etc but with one car dominating the shot none of the rest really have a chance to add to the rhythm of the scene.</td>', 'Hmm, comes across as a strong shoehorn rhythm from someone who happened to be sitting on a bunch of race shots and wanted to get one in the challenge.  I could buy into repeating patterns of dismiliar cars with dismiliar colors, shapes, focus, etc but with one car dominating the shot none of the rest really have a chance to add to the rhythm of the scene.', '2007-07-24 01:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930765, 559178, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not sure what a heidelberg is, but it''s neat how they turn purple when exposed to stronger light...</td>', 'Not sure what a heidelberg is, but it''s neat how they turn purple when exposed to stronger light...', '2007-07-24 01:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930773, 558653, 61818, '<td valign="top">Hope you write some notes on this shot after the challenge, explaining what patterns in it give it a sense of rhythm because I just don''t see it.  If anything its almost devoid of rhythm because the clouds and colors are very soothing and the single plane seems to enhance a sense of calm and isolation.</td>', 'Hope you write some notes on this shot after the challenge, explaining what patterns in it give it a sense of rhythm because I just don''t see it.  If anything its almost devoid of rhythm because the clouds and colors are very soothing and the single plane seems to enhance a sense of calm and isolation.', '2007-07-24 01:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930779, 556748, 61818, '<td valign="top">Some pretty severe noise in the (horrible 70''s looking) green areas, and I''m not even a noise nazi.<br/> <br/>Some very, very strong symmetry and repeating patterns in the main subject area there.  Certainly grabs the challenge topic by the throat!</td>', 'Some pretty severe noise in the (horrible 70''s looking) green areas, and I''m not even a noise nazi. Some very, very strong symmetry and repeating patterns in the main subject area there.  Certainly grabs the challenge topic by the throat!', '2007-07-24 01:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930790, 559278, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns, good composition.  This concept is pretty played out, but you''ve done a decent job with it here.  My personal preference would be a somewhat wider dof to get a bit more of the rings in focus but that''s me, and I didn''t take shot!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice patterns, good composition.  This concept is pretty played out, but you''ve done a decent job with it here.  My personal preference would be a somewhat wider dof to get a bit more of the rings in focus but that''s me, and I didn''t take shot!  Nicely done.', '2007-07-24 01:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930796, 558962, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice way to capture a few different patterns with color, shape and geometry.  The upper right corner suffers from some pretty bad haloing though.</td>', 'Nice way to capture a few different patterns with color, shape and geometry.  The upper right corner suffers from some pretty bad haloing though.', '2007-07-24 01:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930799, 558886, 61818, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a sense of rhythm in this shot.  One subject on one leaf.  Really the only repeating patterns are whats visible in portions of the surface of the leaf.</td>', 'I don''t get a sense of rhythm in this shot.  One subject on one leaf.  Really the only repeating patterns are whats visible in portions of the surface of the leaf.', '2007-07-24 01:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930805, 558220, 61818, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me.  I like how the patterns of horizontal lines also form vertical lines, but the lighting and composition and processing are just not good imo.</td>', 'Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me.  I like how the patterns of horizontal lines also form vertical lines, but the lighting and composition and processing are just not good imo.', '2007-07-24 01:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930811, 558732, 61818, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  I even like how the bare section of wall and pipe break up the rhythm of the rest of the shot.  Wow factor?  None.  But I''ve been clicking through a lot worse on my way here.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  I even like how the bare section of wall and pipe break up the rhythm of the rest of the shot.  Wow factor?  None.  But I''ve been clicking through a lot worse on my way here.', '2007-07-24 01:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930818, 559243, 61818, '<td valign="top">Strange.  I hope you spend more time on this subject using different approaches to lighting, because somewhere out thre is a magic combination of subject and light which would cause this shot to just lay me out.  As it is, it meets the challenge and is certainly unique but it leaves my eyes asking for more.</td>', 'Strange.  I hope you spend more time on this subject using different approaches to lighting, because somewhere out thre is a magic combination of subject and light which would cause this shot to just lay me out.  As it is, it meets the challenge and is certainly unique but it leaves my eyes asking for more.', '2007-07-24 01:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3930866, 558236, 72103, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, however something very "brown" and Dul about it, i''d try upping the contrast and brightness somewhat.</td>', 'Nice concept, however something very "brown" and Dul about it, i''d try upping the contrast and brightness somewhat.', '2007-07-24 01:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
