(3931403, 558732, 73235, '<td valign="top">I have to admit Im having a hard time saying something about this picture. On one hand it''s a burst of colors, nicely contrasting with the bricks and pipe, on the other hand it''s not really interesting. But then again, it made me stay and explore.</td>', 'I have to admit Im having a hard time saying something about this picture. On one hand it''s a burst of colors, nicely contrasting with the bricks and pipe, on the other hand it''s not really interesting. But then again, it made me stay and explore.', '2007-07-24 09:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
