(3931440, 557431, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice idea. would have scored higher if the distance between the steps would have been more even and the relation of each color band the same.</td>', 'nice idea. would have scored higher if the distance between the steps would have been more even and the relation of each color band the same.', '2007-07-24 09:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931449, 558971, 73235, '<td valign="top">the bright background is distracting. the upper part of the background has a nice strong green which is a good contrast to the bark of the tree. The tree itseld seems very soft not really supporting repetition</td>', 'the bright background is distracting. the upper part of the background has a nice strong green which is a good contrast to the bark of the tree. The tree itseld seems very soft not really supporting repetition', '2007-07-24 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931463, 559217, 73235, '<td valign="top">cool idea. A really centered approach could have made the made the composition much stronger. While the photo is very sharp, a bit contrast would add to the depth. I like your interpretation of the challenge</td>', 'cool idea. A really centered approach could have made the made the composition much stronger. While the photo is very sharp, a bit contrast would add to the depth. I like your interpretation of the challenge', '2007-07-24 09:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931497, 558963, 73235, '<td valign="top">This was a very quick and hastily set up picture, wasn''t it?<br/>The dust on the keys is not removed, lighting on the back part really does not exist, while the front is blown out. The background (white door) does not really add anything, except bouncing back some of the light. I do like the perspective of your view. I would have set up the picture such that tops of the white keys would be parallel to the right border of your photo creating a vanishing point in the upper right corner. Not using flash but 2-3 simple lamps to lighten up the entire length of the keys. Just an idea and some suggestions.</td>', 'This was a very quick and hastily set up picture, wasn''t it?The dust on the keys is not removed, lighting on the back part really does not exist, while the front is blown out. The background (white door) does not really add anything, except bouncing back some of the light. I do like the perspective of your view. I would have set up the picture such that tops of the white keys would be parallel to the right border of your photo creating a vanishing point in the upper right corner. Not using flash but 2-3 simple lamps to lighten up the entire length of the keys. Just an idea and some suggestions.', '2007-07-24 09:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931500, 559140, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the idea looking down the a waterfall into the canyon. nice job</td>', 'I like the idea looking down the a waterfall into the canyon. nice job', '2007-07-24 09:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931503, 558412, 73235, '<td valign="top">great composition and DOF</td>', 'great composition and DOF', '2007-07-24 09:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931517, 558197, 73235, '<td valign="top">While your photo does convey rhythm very well, it not really is repeating a theme, does it? Still a great photo. I can hear and fell the rhythm.</td>', 'While your photo does convey rhythm very well, it not really is repeating a theme, does it? Still a great photo. I can hear and fell the rhythm.', '2007-07-24 09:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931520, 559122, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice and moody capture</td>', 'nice and moody capture', '2007-07-24 09:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931527, 559268, 73235, '<td valign="top">beautiful, I love it. This is summer and a great capture of the feeling. Oh, and yes it meets the challenge as well. May a little bit oversharpened (halo), 10</td>', 'beautiful, I love it. This is summer and a great capture of the feeling. Oh, and yes it meets the challenge as well. May a little bit oversharpened (halo), 10', '2007-07-24 09:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931531, 556433, 73235, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, nice contrast</td>', 'interesting composition, nice contrast', '2007-07-24 09:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931541, 558571, 73235, '<td valign="top">appears a bit flat, check the green hose on the right side, also 2 of the boats are cut by your crop. show them or don''t show them just don''t slice and dice them :) nice centered composition though</td>', 'appears a bit flat, check the green hose on the right side, also 2 of the boats are cut by your crop. show them or don''t show them just don''t slice and dice them :) nice centered composition though', '2007-07-24 09:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
