(3933560, 556763, 52169, '<td valign="top">I love this one. Really powerful.</td>', 'I love this one. Really powerful.', '2007-07-24 23:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933616, 559140, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns created by the tree lines on the right and the dark shadows on the left slope.  Not sure I would say they define the shot or add a real sense of rhythm, but overall it''s a nice scene.</td>', 'I like the patterns created by the tree lines on the right and the dark shadows on the left slope.  Not sure I would say they define the shot or add a real sense of rhythm, but overall it''s a nice scene.', '2007-07-24 23:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933623, 559114, 61818, '<td valign="top">The rhythm is escaping me.  No very strong repetition of any subject or theme or pattern.  It''s not a bad shot, but I''m just failing to see how it''s fitting into the challenge.  Look forward to reading your notes afterwards.</td>', 'The rhythm is escaping me.  No very strong repetition of any subject or theme or pattern.  It''s not a bad shot, but I''m just failing to see how it''s fitting into the challenge.  Look forward to reading your notes afterwards.', '2007-07-24 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933626, 559075, 61818, '<td valign="top">Shot meets the challenge.  The lily pads give a nice sense of rhythm to the scene.  Technically the shot needs some work.  The flower is overexposed and almost completely without detail.  Also it might be more pleasing were the subject (the flower) on a thirds intersection.  In the lower left it would nicely anchor the shot.</td>', 'Shot meets the challenge.  The lily pads give a nice sense of rhythm to the scene.  Technically the shot needs some work.  The flower is overexposed and almost completely without detail.  Also it might be more pleasing were the subject (the flower) on a thirds intersection.  In the lower left it would nicely anchor the shot.', '2007-07-24 23:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933630, 558869, 61818, '<td valign="top">A thing you can do to avoid the ugly jaggies on thin diagonal lines (a phenomen that is particularly likely to occur when sizing images to the ridiculous limit imposed on us) is to go back with the history brush and remove the sharpening effect from them.<br/> <br/>Nice shot.  Balloons always look nice.  Not sure if you had many options, but the Remax logo sort of spoils the effect for me.  Adds a very commercial feel to the scene.</td>', 'A thing you can do to avoid the ugly jaggies on thin diagonal lines (a phenomen that is particularly likely to occur when sizing images to the ridiculous limit imposed on us) is to go back with the history brush and remove the sharpening effect from them. Nice shot.  Balloons always look nice.  Not sure if you had many options, but the Remax logo sort of spoils the effect for me.  Adds a very commercial feel to the scene.', '2007-07-24 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933634, 558991, 61818, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really strike me as an abstract.  It''s clearly a mushroom cap.  Very odd choice of aperture here.</td>', 'Doesn''t really strike me as an abstract.  It''s clearly a mushroom cap.  Very odd choice of aperture here.', '2007-07-24 23:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933637, 558874, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not the best composition and the lighting is pretty harsh.  Does meet the challenge as far as I''m concerned, but there''s a lot holding this shot back.  The way the two on the right re looking up almost begs to have this cropped with the log at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'Not the best composition and the lighting is pretty harsh.  Does meet the challenge as far as I''m concerned, but there''s a lot holding this shot back.  The way the two on the right re looking up almost begs to have this cropped with the log at the bottom of the frame.', '2007-07-24 23:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933640, 558974, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice scene with a lot of different rhythms contained within it.  Might have cropped it so the wall vanishes at the left side of the frame rather than that little stub of the other wall showing, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Nice scene with a lot of different rhythms contained within it.  Might have cropped it so the wall vanishes at the left side of the frame rather than that little stub of the other wall showing, but that''s just my opinion.', '2007-07-24 23:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933645, 559283, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, like the processing.  Don''t think you made the most of this though as the composition could use some work.  Then again who has all day to sit around waiting for a crowd to fall into a pleasing formation by chance?  Still, were the main pair a bit lower and to the left it might add a bit of balance, reduce the chaos, and anchor the shot.</td>', 'I like the idea, like the processing.  Don''t think you made the most of this though as the composition could use some work.  Then again who has all day to sit around waiting for a crowd to fall into a pleasing formation by chance?  Still, were the main pair a bit lower and to the left it might add a bit of balance, reduce the chaos, and anchor the shot.', '2007-07-24 23:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933647, 559106, 61818, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the processing.  Meets the challenge on a number of levels, but I just can''t get past the effect.</td>', 'Don''t care for the processing.  Meets the challenge on a number of levels, but I just can''t get past the effect.', '2007-07-24 23:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933650, 559042, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice but really begs to have a healthy dose of contrast added to provide some tonal separation.  It''s a bit washed out as is, which is a shame because this is a very appealing shot and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'This is quite nice but really begs to have a healthy dose of contrast added to provide some tonal separation.  It''s a bit washed out as is, which is a shame because this is a very appealing shot and fits the challenge well.', '2007-07-24 23:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933657, 558809, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not bad, not bad.  Might work better with the first chair closer to the left edge of the frame, and what would be the harm in a smaller aperture giving my eyes the full line of chairs to feast upon in great detail?  Like the tones here for some reason.  Not usually a big fan of sepia but this is very appealing.</td>', 'Not bad, not bad.  Might work better with the first chair closer to the left edge of the frame, and what would be the harm in a smaller aperture giving my eyes the full line of chairs to feast upon in great detail?  Like the tones here for some reason.  Not usually a big fan of sepia but this is very appealing.', '2007-07-24 23:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933662, 559214, 61818, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice about this shot is the tilt.  When all you''ve got to show the class is two shades of horizontal lines, ''horizontal'' is a very important thing in my mind.  Other than that, meets the challenge but doesn''t offer much beyond that I''m afraid.</td>', 'First thing I notice about this shot is the tilt.  When all you''ve got to show the class is two shades of horizontal lines, ''horizontal'' is a very important thing in my mind.  Other than that, meets the challenge but doesn''t offer much beyond that I''m afraid.', '2007-07-24 23:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933664, 559267, 61818, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh making all those little hotspots.  Meets the challenge.  Can''t say I''m getting excited over it as it''s been done with pencils and crayons and every other colorful thing, but this is ceratinly no worse than most of the other shots in this genre that I have seen before.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh making all those little hotspots.  Meets the challenge.  Can''t say I''m getting excited over it as it''s been done with pencils and crayons and every other colorful thing, but this is ceratinly no worse than most of the other shots in this genre that I have seen before.', '2007-07-24 23:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933671, 559180, 61818, '<td valign="top">From the horizon up, this is a nice shot.  Unfortunately what''s below the horizon is the tie in to the challenge and there''s some trouble there.  Lots of overexposed spots on the waves, the big out of focus area in the foreground is disconcerting, and there''s no strong presentation of wave like shapes themselves within the watery chaos.  Do like those mountains though, and the sky is nicely captured as well.</td>', 'From the horizon up, this is a nice shot.  Unfortunately what''s below the horizon is the tie in to the challenge and there''s some trouble there.  Lots of overexposed spots on the waves, the big out of focus area in the foreground is disconcerting, and there''s no strong presentation of wave like shapes themselves within the watery chaos.  Do like those mountains though, and the sky is nicely captured as well.', '2007-07-24 23:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933675, 559279, 61818, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge, lighting isn''t bad, nicely focused.  It''s probably hard to find a novel approach to this sort of subject as its been done quite a lot, but this is pretty good.</td>', 'Meets challenge, lighting isn''t bad, nicely focused.  It''s probably hard to find a novel approach to this sort of subject as its been done quite a lot, but this is pretty good.', '2007-07-24 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933677, 558963, 61818, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting, composition, contrast.  Meets the challenge, otherwise has pretty much no appeal at all.</td>', 'Poor lighting, composition, contrast.  Meets the challenge, otherwise has pretty much no appeal at all.', '2007-07-24 23:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933680, 558888, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the choice of exposure was conscious here, but the hot spot in the upper right is pretty hard to get past.  May as well have just jumped all the way in and gone for a complete silhouette of the girl (foregoing all detail on her) to bring the highlights of the scene undercontrol.  If even possible.  I think this might have just been an impossibly lit scene.</td>', 'Not sure if the choice of exposure was conscious here, but the hot spot in the upper right is pretty hard to get past.  May as well have just jumped all the way in and gone for a complete silhouette of the girl (foregoing all detail on her) to bring the highlights of the scene undercontrol.  If even possible.  I think this might have just been an impossibly lit scene.', '2007-07-24 23:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933682, 558741, 61818, '<td valign="top">A nice, soothing scene which still meets the challenge.  Good capture.</td>', 'A nice, soothing scene which still meets the challenge.  Good capture.', '2007-07-24 23:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933685, 559259, 61818, '<td valign="top">Looks like a corn field in hell or something with that crazy, evil sky.  Don''t care for the processing at all and find it impossible to get past.  Good luck.</td>', 'Looks like a corn field in hell or something with that crazy, evil sky.  Don''t care for the processing at all and find it impossible to get past.  Good luck.', '2007-07-24 23:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933687, 557700, 61818, '<td valign="top">Think this would have more appeal were all the dots in focus.  Meets the challenge.  Do like the nice gradients formed on the white dots.</td>', 'Think this would have more appeal were all the dots in focus.  Meets the challenge.  Do like the nice gradients formed on the white dots.', '2007-07-24 23:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933690, 558882, 61818, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but do not care for the effect applied to the shot.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but do not care for the effect applied to the shot.', '2007-07-24 23:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933691, 558502, 61818, '<td valign="top">Like the leading lines and there''s some nice patterns in this shot.</td>', 'Like the leading lines and there''s some nice patterns in this shot.', '2007-07-24 23:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933696, 559160, 61818, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering how a tombstone can be overexposed when shot in the middle of the night...  Nice idea.  Composition could use some work though.  Generally its advisable to avoid splitting a shot in half with the horizon line.</td>', 'I''m wondering how a tombstone can be overexposed when shot in the middle of the night...  Nice idea.  Composition could use some work though.  Generally its advisable to avoid splitting a shot in half with the horizon line.', '2007-07-24 23:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933700, 557151, 61818, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, meets the challenge.  I have no doubt people are tossing 10''s at this shot like there''s no tomorrow.</td>', 'Very pretty, meets the challenge.  I have no doubt people are tossing 10''s at this shot like there''s no tomorrow.', '2007-07-24 23:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933703, 559221, 61818, '<td valign="top">I have taken this shot myself and almost considered doing it again for the challenge.  Works well for the theme and is very appealing to me.  Nice job.</td>', 'I have taken this shot myself and almost considered doing it again for the challenge.  Works well for the theme and is very appealing to me.  Nice job.', '2007-07-24 23:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3933706, 559223, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not bad and certainly a creative entry.  Wonder if you couldn''t have found bolder patterns to present just by finding a different perch to take the shot from.  I''m thinking a few seconds earlier the barrels of those guns were lined up in a nice fashion shouting ''photograph us! we''re challenge material!'' heheh.</td>', 'Not bad and certainly a creative entry.  Wonder if you couldn''t have found bolder patterns to present just by finding a different perch to take the shot from.  I''m thinking a few seconds earlier the barrels of those guns were lined up in a nice fashion shouting ''photograph us! we''re challenge material!'' heheh.', '2007-07-24 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
