(3940692, 556378, 65319, '<td valign="top">The composition, color and exquisite detail make this photo stunning.  I would have liked to see more variation/gradients in the color values to bring out a sense of movement.  No doubt this one will land Top 10 at the very least.  I''m not voting this challenge, but wish you Good Luck!</td>', 'The composition, color and exquisite detail make this photo stunning.  I would have liked to see more variation/gradients in the color values to bring out a sense of movement.  No doubt this one will land Top 10 at the very least.  I''m not voting this challenge, but wish you Good Luck!', '2007-07-26 19:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
