(3940927, 558470, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love the angle of this.  I don''t think this image would have been half as strong if you had done it straight.  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the angle of this.  I don''t think this image would have been half as strong if you had done it straight.  Good luck.', '2007-07-26 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
