(3941466, 559214, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but it needs something. Maybe changing the angle a bit?</td>', 'Nice idea but it needs something. Maybe changing the angle a bit?', '2007-07-27 00:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
