(3941471, 558094, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here but it needs something. A more oblique angle but create some interesting lines. This angle is somewhat bland.</td>', 'I like the idea here but it needs something. A more oblique angle but create some interesting lines. This angle is somewhat bland.', '2007-07-27 00:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941475, 559042, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition works well with it. The sky is so flat though. Exposing for the sky would help for starters. Your black and white conversion would have also helped. Actually maybe a color version of this would be cool to see too? You could also burn the sky a bit as this is under Advanced.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition works well with it. The sky is so flat though. Exposing for the sky would help for starters. Your black and white conversion would have also helped. Actually maybe a color version of this would be cool to see too? You could also burn the sky a bit as this is under Advanced.', '2007-07-27 00:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941476, 557863, 66515, '<td valign="top">Without the title I don''t feel this is has a strong connection to the challenge. Very nice image otherwise though. I like the visual connection you have created.</td>', 'Without the title I don''t feel this is has a strong connection to the challenge. Very nice image otherwise though. I like the visual connection you have created.', '2007-07-27 00:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941479, 559268, 66515, '<td valign="top">I really want to mark this as DNMC but I can''t. I love this image so much that I find myself shoe horning it. lol...<br/> <br/>Simple composition but very effective. I like the angle you chose. The sky is great and the colors are terrific. The shallow DOF is what really makes this shot I think. I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'I really want to mark this as DNMC but I can''t. I love this image so much that I find myself shoe horning it. lol... Simple composition but very effective. I like the angle you chose. The sky is great and the colors are terrific. The shallow DOF is what really makes this shot I think. I hope this does well for you.', '2007-07-27 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941481, 558673, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think you got too cutesy with the title. <br/> <br/>That aside I like the IR. The clouds and the sky are quite striking. I like the shadows of the clouds you captured.</td>', 'I like this but I think you got too cutesy with the title.  That aside I like the IR. The clouds and the sky are quite striking. I like the shadows of the clouds you captured.', '2007-07-27 00:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3941542, 558477, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines, and interesting subject. Well done.</td>', 'Great leading lines, and interesting subject. Well done.', '2007-07-27 01:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
