(3942043, 558220, 74533, '<td valign="top">I had the idea of use disks but didn''t because I couldn''t get a look that I was happy with.  Your idea is good.  I would have cropped a bit more off the top so that you loose the top bit of the disks.</td>', 'I had the idea of use disks but didn''t because I couldn''t get a look that I was happy with.  Your idea is good.  I would have cropped a bit more off the top so that you loose the top bit of the disks.', '2007-07-27 07:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942046, 558201, 74533, '<td valign="top">Colourful.  Good idea.  I wish the light blue note wasn''t partially hidden.  It wouldhave looked better below the yellow and orange one.</td>', 'Colourful.  Good idea.  I wish the light blue note wasn''t partially hidden.  It wouldhave looked better below the yellow and orange one.', '2007-07-27 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
