(3942050, 558874, 74533, '<td valign="top">How cute.  A little more colour and contrast to make the turtles stand out a bit more would have been good.</td>', 'How cute.  A little more colour and contrast to make the turtles stand out a bit more would have been good.', '2007-07-27 07:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
