(3942059, 558653, 74533, '<td valign="top">This photo is great.  Not sure that I feel it fulfills rhythm for me.  I love the the colours and smoothness of the clouds and the contrast of the  plane.  Did you take this through a window to get this effect?</td>', 'This photo is great.  Not sure that I feel it fulfills rhythm for me.  I love the the colours and smoothness of the clouds and the contrast of the  plane.  Did you take this through a window to get this effect?', '2007-07-27 07:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3942062, 559107, 74533, '<td valign="top">What a great photo.  Can see you!! But I dont think that take away from the photo.  I like the repeated silver, even if its only a twinkle in the background.  The colors are lovely and keep it interesting.</td>', 'What a great photo.  Can see you!! But I dont think that take away from the photo.  I like the repeated silver, even if its only a twinkle in the background.  The colors are lovely and keep it interesting.', '2007-07-27 07:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
