(3944563, 558098, 74015, '<td valign="top">I like the rythm and guess that it is probably rain but having nothing in focus bothers me a bit...</td>', 'I like the rythm and guess that it is probably rain but having nothing in focus bothers me a bit...', '2007-07-28 09:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
