(3944576, 559232, 74015, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W treatment you gave this image.  The rythm of it is not as strong as other pictures in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the B&W treatment you gave this image.  The rythm of it is not as strong as other pictures in the challenge.', '2007-07-28 09:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944580, 558440, 74015, '<td valign="top">Geological formation??  I like the rythm in this but I find the light a bit flat.  Increased contrast and saturation would have helped IMO.</td>', 'Geological formation??  I like the rythm in this but I find the light a bit flat.  Increased contrast and saturation would have helped IMO.', '2007-07-28 09:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944588, 558888, 74015, '<td valign="top">Over exposed and I don''t see the "rythm" in it.  This shot had great potential but you should have chosen a different angle to keep the extremely bright sun out of the frame.  It is impossible to get a correct exposure when there is so much contrast in one shot.</td>', 'Over exposed and I don''t see the "rythm" in it.  This shot had great potential but you should have chosen a different angle to keep the extremely bright sun out of the frame.  It is impossible to get a correct exposure when there is so much contrast in one shot.', '2007-07-28 09:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944589, 559107, 74015, '<td valign="top">Oooohhh!  I really love this.  It''s like the image starts in B&amp;W and move into technicolor at the back.  There''s rythm in the marbles, rythm in the no-color-to-color... 8 for me!</td>', 'Oooohhh!  I really love this.  It''s like the image starts in B&W and move into technicolor at the back.  There''s rythm in the marbles, rythm in the no-color-to-color... 8 for me!', '2007-07-28 09:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944595, 559230, 74015, '<td valign="top">The image is a little boring for me: flat lighting, central composition, eye view angle...</td>', 'The image is a little boring for me: flat lighting, central composition, eye view angle...', '2007-07-28 09:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944596, 559042, 72103, '<td valign="top">almost brilliant......I just think it looks a litle grey, I''d try and get the the blacks more black.  Either more contrast or greater use of "curves"...still a 8 for potential</td>', 'almost brilliant......I just think it looks a litle grey, I''d try and get the the blacks more black.  Either more contrast or greater use of "curves"...still a 8 for potential', '2007-07-28 09:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944599, 559268, 74015, '<td valign="top">I like how the wheat color plays off the blue sky.  Nice use of DOF too.</td>', 'I like how the wheat color plays off the blue sky.  Nice use of DOF too.', '2007-07-28 09:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3944600, 558898, 72103, '<td valign="top">awesone, only spoilt by the "colour curves" coming from the inside. A conatst change would have been brilliant!  Still an 8 thou!</td>', 'awesone, only spoilt by the "colour curves" coming from the inside. A conatst change would have been brilliant!  Still an 8 thou!', '2007-07-28 09:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
