(3948623, 558803, 39427, '<td valign="top">4.9??!  143/157??! Thats ridiculous.  While I cant say that this should be a ribbon winner, this photo is so much more going for it than a huge portion of the pics that scored higher.  Having said that, me thinks the center portion of this photograph could use some work.  I love the left and right sides of this image, the colors, tones, etc.  I just wish that cruise ship wasn''t visible- like maybe I would have just dodge''d it out completely, lol... anyway, underrated :P.</td>', '4.9??!  143/157??! Thats ridiculous.  While I cant say that this should be a ribbon winner, this photo is so much more going for it than a huge portion of the pics that scored higher.  Having said that, me thinks the center portion of this photograph could use some work.  I love the left and right sides of this image, the colors, tones, etc.  I just wish that cruise ship wasn''t visible- like maybe I would have just dodge''d it out completely, lol... anyway, underrated :P.', '2007-07-30 04:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
