(3949419, 559019, 60862, '<td valign="top">Me likey muchly.  My only suggestion would be to crop out the blurred leaf on the right.  Blur can work, but in this case because it''s the only thing not sharp, it draws my attention away from the main subject.  That''ll change it to a portrait orientation, but you could also crop out some of the stuff at the top if you wanted to keep the same proportions.</td>', 'Me likey muchly.  My only suggestion would be to crop out the blurred leaf on the right.  Blur can work, but in this case because it''s the only thing not sharp, it draws my attention away from the main subject.  That''ll change it to a portrait orientation, but you could also crop out some of the stuff at the top if you wanted to keep the same proportions.', '2007-07-30 11:39:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3949422, 557018, 60862, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool experiment, Julianne. :)</td>', 'That''s a cool experiment, Julianne. :)', '2007-07-30 11:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
