(3949436, 559200, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, Maxine.  Congrats on your new 5th-best!  I think cropping off some of the top and enhancing the lightness on the fence to show more detail would help this score even higher.</td>', 'Hey, Maxine.  Congrats on your new 5th-best!  I think cropping off some of the top and enhancing the lightness on the fence to show more detail would help this score even higher.', '2007-07-30 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 0),
