(3949461, 558098, 60862, '<td valign="top">Michelle, I voted this a 5, and I''m trying to figure out what I''d prefer.  It''s nothing glaring, and I think the final score reflects that, but there''s also not much to grab me by the throat.  Maybe enhancing contrast so the bright parts are really white?  Of course, if you like it the way it is, then great!</td>', 'Michelle, I voted this a 5, and I''m trying to figure out what I''d prefer.  It''s nothing glaring, and I think the final score reflects that, but there''s also not much to grab me by the throat.  Maybe enhancing contrast so the bright parts are really white?  Of course, if you like it the way it is, then great!', '2007-07-30 11:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3949484, 557018, 40973, '<td valign="top">It does remind one of dessert from a fancy restaurant. Aren''t those ladyfingers?</td>', 'It does remind one of dessert from a fancy restaurant. Aren''t those ladyfingers?', '2007-07-30 11:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
