(4086454, 558361, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sandy, I''m back for a second comment.  This shot could be used to demonstrate so many things about good photography.  First, there''s that strong horizon line that is nicely off-center vertically.  Then, there are the patterns in the graves that you caught so well, and at such a nice angle instead of face-on.  I also really like the contrast between the hard-edged, manmade gravestones and the soft, organic shapes of the trees.  And finally, there''s the light, the glorious light!</td>', 'Sandy, I''m back for a second comment.  This shot could be used to demonstrate so many things about good photography.  First, there''s that strong horizon line that is nicely off-center vertically.  Then, there are the patterns in the graves that you caught so well, and at such a nice angle instead of face-on.  I also really like the contrast between the hard-edged, manmade gravestones and the soft, organic shapes of the trees.  And finally, there''s the light, the glorious light!', '2007-09-13 01:01:52.000000', NULL, 0),
